        "short_help": "Usage: prepare [OPTIONS] --capabilities <CAPABILITIES>\n\nOptions:\n  -C <checkout>                      \n      --capabilities <CAPABILITIES>  \n      --format <FORMAT>              Human output on terminals, JSON on pipes, or compact NDJSON observations [env: PSE_FORMAT] [default: auto] [possible values: auto, human, json, ndjson]\n      --fields <FIELDS>              Select comma-separated payload fields while retaining identity, state and coverage\n      --budget <BUDGET>              Limit payload array records; retain complete evidence as an artifact\n  -h, --help                         Print help (see more with '--help')\n",
        "long_help": "Usage: prepare [OPTIONS] --capabilities <CAPABILITIES>\n\nOptions:\n  -C <checkout>\n          \n\n      --capabilities <CAPABILITIES>\n          \n\n      --format <FORMAT>\n          Human output on terminals, JSON on pipes, or compact NDJSON observations\n\n          Possible values:\n          - auto:   Human for a terminal, JSON for pipes\n          - human:  Concise summary and pretty structured detail\n          - json:   One JSON envelope\n          - ndjson: Compact normalized records followed by an observation summary\n          \n          [env: PSE_FORMAT]\n          [default: auto]\n\n      --fields <FIELDS>\n          Select comma-separated payload fields while retaining identity, state and coverage\n\n      --budget <BUDGET>\n          Limit payload array records; retain complete evidence as an artifact\n\n  -h, --help\n          Print help (see a summary with '-h')\n",
